<title>CHILE: Chilectra Q1 net profit higher.</title>
<headline>Chilectra Q1 net profit higher.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chilectra SA reported the following results for the first quarter of 1997.</p>
<p>			    Q1 1997		  Q1 1996</p>
<p>Net profit		  18.1			16.6</p>
<p>Operating profit	  13.9			12.4</p>
<p>Non-operating profit     7.08			7.12</p>
<p>Total revenues	     N.A.			N.A.</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures in billions of Chilean pesos. ((-- Roger Atwood, Santiago newsroom +56-2-6995595 x211))</p>
</text>
